{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/4ef48e9c7a6f3a9829250f5ded7681d5.poster.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/4ef48e9c7a6f3a9829250f5ded7681d5.webm?t=1771384366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Season Content Roadmap</strong> \u2728<br>This release is <strong>Episode 1 of 3</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2</strong> will arrive as a <strong>free DLC ~ November 2025 ~ 1600 images and 100 animations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 3</strong> is planned as a <strong>free DLC ~ March 2026\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\"> </span>2500 images and 120 animations<br><span class=\"bb_strike\"></span>Total Season content - 5300 images and ~ 380 animations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you buy the game, you\u2019re getting the <strong>entire season</strong> \u2014 all future episodes will unlock automatically at no extra cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of <strong>Sofia</strong>, a 35-year-old successful influencer and real estate agent who seems to have it all: beauty, status, and wealth. But behind the perfect fa\u00e7ade, she struggles with the cracks in her marriage and the weight of unspoken fantasies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Sofia installs the mysterious <strong>Veil App</strong>, her hidden desires begin to blur with reality, pulling her into a world where choices carry emotional and erotic consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll experience the first Episode of her internal conflict between ambition, lust, and loyalty \u2014 all through a <strong>female-written story</strong> that adds authenticity and perspective rarely seen in the genre.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total of\u00a0<strong>1954</strong> total images\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>3.5 hours</strong> of Incredible Game time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main plotline is\u00a0<strong>1,830 Polished</strong> <strong>images / 1830 Blender images\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>124 Polished</strong> images in the Extra <strong>Visual</strong>\u00a0<strong>Short Story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>156+ fluid animations</strong> totaling <strong>45+ minutes</strong> of cinematic content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/916685b5285ff699b9e91b4cf41a7315.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1560 height=95 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/fac97ed6670fded444502df7a9f07f3c.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1560 height=509 /></span>In Sofia\u2019s Dark Fantasies, <strong>your decisions shape her path.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you explore her wildest fantasies, letting her indulge in forbidden encounters?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you guide her toward staying loyal to her husband and protecting her reputation?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice alters relationships, unlocks new scenarios, and changes Sofia\u2019s journey \u2014 creating high replay value and multiple branching outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/916685b5285ff699b9e91b4cf41a7315.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/4233255ee4de3d1c2fbec853f463350a.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1560 height=509 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total of\u00a0<strong>1954</strong> total images\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>3.5 hours</strong> of Incredible Game time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main plotline is\u00a0<strong>1,830 Polished</strong> <strong>images and 1830 Blender images\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>124 Polished</strong> images in the Extra <strong>Visual</strong>\u00a0<strong>Short Story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>156 fluid animations</strong> totaling <strong>40+ minutes</strong> of cinematic content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>54 NSFW animations</strong> totaling <strong>30 minutes</strong> of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully rendered in <strong>native 4K</strong> with a unique Blender + <strong>AI polish pipeline</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric lighting, dynamic camera work, and cinematic transitions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/916685b5285ff699b9e91b4cf41a7315.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/54330c60c29f3830c4bc4b6e68cd4933.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1560 height=509 /></span>Around <strong>3.5 hours of playtime</strong> for Episode 1 Reimagined</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully rewritten script with <strong>17,000+ words</strong> of dialogue and narrati