ohol or any self harm.\r\n\r\nThe does feature sex scenes, with blowjob, vaginal penetration and anal penetration but all based on Sofia's choices and her progression."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/4ef48e9c7a6f3a9829250f5ded7681d5.poster.avif?t=1771384366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112290/extras/4ef48e9c7a6f3a9829250f5ded7681d5.webm?t=1771384366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Season Content Roadmap</strong> \u2728<br>This release is <strong>Episode 1 of 3</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2</strong> will arrive as a <strong>free DLC ~ November 2025 ~ 1600 images and 100 animations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 3</strong> is planned as a <strong>free DLC ~ March 2026\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\"> </span>2500 images and 120 animations<br><span class=\"bb_strike\"></span>Total Season content - 5300 images and ~ 380 animations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you buy the game, you\u2019re getting the <strong>entire season</strong> \u2014 all future episodes will unlock automatically at no extra cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of <strong>Sofia</strong>, a 35-year-old successful influencer and real estate agent who seems to have it all: beauty, status, and wealth. But behind the perfect fa\u00e7ade, she struggles with the cracks in her marriage and the weight of unspoken fantasies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Sofia installs the mysterious <strong>Veil App</strong>, her hidden desires begin to blur with reality, pulling her into a world where choices carry emotional and erotic